# Kor Firewalker: "Protection from red. Whenever a player casts a red spell, you may gain 1 life." Bot2's Firewalker blocks
# Bot1's red Embereth Shieldbreaker (2/1) on turn 3: protection prevents the Shieldbreaker's 2 (CR 702.16e, recorded as the
# Firewalker's), and the Firewalker's 2 kills it. After combat Bot1 can't target the Firewalker with Lightning Bolt
# (CR 702.16b) but Bolts Bot2 - the positive control. Each Bolt is a red spell an opponent cast: the trigger resolves before it
# (the ruling), Bot2 takes the 1 life the first time and declines the second. Bot2 ends at 20 + 1 - 3 - 3 = 15. Bot1's own
# Shieldbreaker, cast before the Firewalker was on the battlefield, triggered nothing, and nor does a colorless Mox
# Jet cast with it there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Embereth Shieldbreaker
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mox Jet
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Kor Firewalker
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Embereth Shieldbreaker.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Kor Firewalker.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
! Bot2.Accept
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Embereth Shieldbreaker > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Kor Firewalker > Embereth Shieldbreaker)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Kor Firewalker.Damage = 0
? Bot1.Graveyard = Embereth Shieldbreaker
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Kor Firewalker)
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Accept
? Bot2.Life = 21
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Decline
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
Prevented = 2 Embereth Shieldbreaker > Kor Firewalker by Kor Firewalker
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt; Embereth Shieldbreaker
Bot2.Battlefield = Kor Firewalker; Mox Pearl; Plains
